{
  "title": "Syrian Peas Paella",
  "description": "A lightly flaky and peppery Syrian dish featuring petit pois, made in a paella pan and suitable for a midnight craving. This jain-friendly recipe is shaped like nigiri for a unique presentation.",
  "cuisine": "Syrian",
